    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Chronicles Reborn</i>, journey through a vast open-world as you gather resources, craft weapons, and uncover ancient secrets. As a member of the Brightwyn Order, it\u2019s your duty to recover lost knowledge, rescue imprisoned comrades, and build a legacy in a world filled with peril and wonder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With survival at its core, your adventure will take you across diverse biomes, each offering unique resources, enemies, and mysteries to uncover. Along the way, build your sanctuary, tame animals, and unlock powerful new abilities to aid in your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE AND THRIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather essential resources from your surroundings to craft weapons, armor, and vital tools. Prepare food, potions, and magical equipment to keep yourself alive as you battle enemies, explore ancient ruins, and solve puzzles to uncover the world\u2019s secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/c7fa4be6f767e3bc8c40c3da81bc8ff3.poster.avif?t=1753193718\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/c7fa4be6f767e3bc8c40c3da81bc8ff3.webm?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/c7fa4be6f767e3bc8c40c3da81bc8ff3.mp4?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAME, HUNT, AND RIDE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track down wild animals for food and materials, or tame them to help with various tasks. Ride your mounts across the vast landscapes, or raise livestock to produce vital resources like milk, eggs, and wool. Each animal you tame can aid in your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/2e8688cea3b1a075c5f35f7c6f258680.poster.avif?t=1753193718\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/2e8688cea3b1a075c5f35f7c6f258680.webm?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/2e8688cea3b1a075c5f35f7c6f258680.mp4?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE AND BUILD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an interconnected world map with unique locations, hidden lore, and secrets to discover. Build and customize your sanctuary, a place to store your treasures and defend against enemies. Personalize your home and craft advanced structures to improve your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/f9cbf8fb1e408c7980e129c9a2538484.poster.avif?t=1753193718\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/f9cbf8fb1e408c7980e129c9a2538484.webm?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/f9cbf8fb1e408c7980e129c9a2538484.mp4?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER COMBAT AND MAGIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your combat style\u2014whether wielding swords, maces, or bows, or mastering the arcane with staves and spells. Engage enemies up close or attack from a distance with ranged weapons, adapting your strategies to survive in a dangerous world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/c652792ea44b624576f3f0240baf00b2.poster.avif?t=1753193718\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/c652792ea44b624576f3f0240baf00b2.webm?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/c652792ea44b624576f3f0240baf00b2.mp4?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>FARM, GROW, AND HARVEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate crops to sustain yourself and craft magical items. Use strategic farming techniques to ensure your land remains fertile, and raise livestock to produce essential materials. Grow your resources and build a thriving life amidst the wilds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/620e7f4f0da5b44b05fc33d3bb56f7ec.poster.avif?t=1753193718\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/620e7f4f0da5b44b05fc33d3bb56f7ec.webm?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/620e7f4f0da5b44b05fc33d3bb56f7ec.mp4?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK LOST KNOWLEDGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover the ancient knowledge hidden throughout the world. Complete quests for NPCs, earn Knowledge Points, and unlock new crafting recipes and abilities. The more knowledge you recover, the more powerful your character becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/f182666528e27ef0182620d3d5193729.poster.avif?t=1753193718\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/f182666528e27ef0182620d3d5193729.webm?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/f182666528e27ef0182620d3d5193729.mp4?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SINGLE-PLAYER ADVENTURE WITH MULTIPLAYER PLANS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, <i>Chronicles Reborn</i> offers a rich single-player experience. However, we\u2019re planning to expand into multiplayer, allowing you to share your adventures with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOIN OUR COMMUNITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect with us on Discord to stay updated, share your feedback, and help shape the future of <i>Chronicles Reborn</i> as we continue developing the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Chronicles Reborn</i>, journey through a vast open-world as you gather resources, craft weapons, and uncover ancient secrets. As a member of the Brightwyn Order, it\u2019s your duty to recover lost knowledge, rescue imprisoned comrades, and build a legacy in a world filled with peril and wonder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With survival at its core, your adventure will take you across diverse biomes, each offering unique resources, enemies, and mysteries to uncover. Along the way, build your sanctuary, tame animals, and unlock powerful new abilities to aid in your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE AND THRIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather essential resources from your surroundings to craft weapons, armor, and vital tools. Prepare food, potions, and magical equipment to keep yourself alive as you battle enemies, explore ancient ruins, and solve puzzles to uncover the world\u2019s secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/c7fa4be6f767e3bc8c40c3da81bc8ff3.poster.avif?t=1753193718\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/c7fa4be6f767e3bc8c40c3da81bc8ff3.webm?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/c7fa4be6f767e3bc8c40c3da81bc8ff3.mp4?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAME, HUNT, AND RIDE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track down wild animals for food and materials, or tame them to help with various tasks. Ride your mounts across the vast landscapes, or raise livestock to produce vital resources like milk, eggs, and wool. Each animal you tame can aid in your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/2e8688cea3b1a075c5f35f7c6f258680.poster.avif?t=1753193718\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/2e8688cea3b1a075c5f35f7c6f258680.webm?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/2e8688cea3b1a075c5f35f7c6f258680.mp4?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE AND BUILD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an interconnected world map with unique locations, hidden lore, and secrets to discover. Build and customize your sanctuary, a place to store your treasures and defend against enemies. Personalize your home and craft advanced structures to improve your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/f9cbf8fb1e408c7980e129c9a2538484.poster.avif?t=1753193718\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/f9cbf8fb1e408c7980e129c9a2538484.webm?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/f9cbf8fb1e408c7980e129c9a2538484.mp4?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER COMBAT AND MAGIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your combat style\u2014whether wielding swords, maces, or bows, or mastering the arcane with staves and spells. Engage enemies up close or attack from a distance with ranged weapons, adapting your strategies to survive in a dangerous world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/c652792ea44b624576f3f0240baf00b2.poster.avif?t=1753193718\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/c652792ea44b624576f3f0240baf00b2.webm?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/c652792ea44b624576f3f0240baf00b2.mp4?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>FARM, GROW, AND HARVEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate crops to sustain yourself and craft magical items. Use strategic farming techniques to ensure your land remains fertile, and raise livestock to produce essential materials. Grow your resources and build a thriving life amidst the wilds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/620e7f4f0da5b44b05fc33d3bb56f7ec.poster.avif?t=1753193718\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/620e7f4f0da5b44b05fc33d3bb56f7ec.webm?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/620e7f4f0da5b44b05fc33d3bb56f7ec.mp4?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK LOST KNOWLEDGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover the ancient knowledge hidden throughout the world. Complete quests for NPCs, earn Knowledge Points, and unlock new crafting recipes and abilities. The more knowledge you recover, the more powerful your character becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/f182666528e27ef0182620d3d5193729.poster.avif?t=1753193718\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/f182666528e27ef0182620d3d5193729.webm?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325210/extras/f182666528e27ef0182620d3d5193729.mp4?t=1753193718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SINGLE-PLAYER ADVENTURE WITH MULTIPLAYER PLANS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, <i>Chronicles Reborn</i> offers a rich single-player experience. However, we\u2019re planning to expand into multiplayer, allowing you to share your adventures with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOIN OUR COMMUNITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect with us on Discord to stay updated, share your feedback, and help shape the future of <i>Chronicles Reborn</i> as we continue developing the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "As a sworn protector of the Brightwyn Order, uncover lost knowledge in a world rich with secrets. Gather resources, master ancient skills, and face formidable foes across diverse biomes. Build, craft, and fight your way through a vast land filled with quests, mysteries, and untold adventures.",
